cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."
title: "Code for Reducing Uncertainty: The Role of Street-View and Satellite Imagery in Multimodal Informal Settlement Extraction"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
license: MIT

authors:
  - given-names: Pengyu
    family-names: Wang
    affiliation: University College Dublin

abstract: >
  Code accompanying the study "Reducing Uncertainty: The Role of
  Street-View and Satellite Imagery in Multimodal Informal Settlement
  Extraction". The repository contains code for data preprocessing,
  multimodal model training and evaluation, GSV influence analysis,
  leave-one-out analysis, Grad-CAM and semantic interpretation, and
  full-area prediction in Nairobi, Kenya.

keywords:
  - informal settlements
  - multimodal data fusion
  - Google Street View
  - remote sensing
  - deep learning
